;en&#34;&gt;Attention Is All You ...</description> <link>https://note.elliotttzhang.cn/ROBOTICS/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 11:19:55 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://note.elliotttzhang.cn/feed_rss_updated.xml">Note</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://note.elliotttzhang.cn/ROBOTICS/</guid> </item> </channel> </rss>